{"unit_id":"comeonzhj__dsh-intelligent-ui#card-zh","repo":"comeonzhj/dsh-intelligent-ui","commit":"68426b8477915a6cb469d2179c4eeccc5d575d69","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"Intelligent UI 是面向 DSH Web 客户端的生成式界面插件。模型用 DIL（Markdown、组件标签和 JavaScript 语句）描述界面，宿主编译并校验组件属性，再由浏览器端运行时渲染为文字和交互卡片。它提供交付答案的 render_ui 与向用户提问的 ask_with_ui，可制作表单、选项卡片、统计面板和图表；用户操作先在浏览器本地处理，提交后作为会话消息返回模型。适合希望让 DSH 回答包含可操作界面、或通过卡片收集用户选择的场景。配置可控制提示说明、组件详情和工具语言。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:255-285","src/client/app.js:24-41","src/client/app.js:835-849"]}
{"unit_id":"comeonzhj__dsh-intelligent-ui#card-en","repo":"comeonzhj/dsh-intelligent-ui","commit":"68426b8477915a6cb469d2179c4eeccc5d575d69","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"Intelligent UI adds interactive cards to DSH web. The model writes DIL, which the host compiles and checks before rendering. render_ui delivers answers; ask_with_ui presents forms and choices. Charts and metric panels are supported. Interactions run locally; submitted values return to the session.","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:255-285","src/client/app.js:24-41","src/client/app.js:835-849"]}
