{"unit_id":"comeonzhj__dsh-intelligent-ui#feature-1","repo":"comeonzhj/dsh-intelligent-ui","commit":"68426b8477915a6cb469d2179c4eeccc5d575d69","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"Intelligent UI 的功能「交付式界面」：模型调用 render_ui 提交 DIL，宿主编译后由浏览器渲染为文字与富卡片；支持流式内容逐步显示。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:106-116","src/client/app.js:6-16"]}
